		"source": "RP2350 datasheet (build 01/10/2026) §14.9.7: hello_serial at 150 MHz 51.1 mW total at 3.3 V = 15.5 mA (Table 1693); low-power state P1.0 548 µW = 166 µA, the deepest P1.7 188 µW = 57 µA (Table 1692); Bringup has no RP2350 firmware, so which state it would sleep in is open and the higher figure is taken. No minimum supply current stated; 100 mA is Bringup's margin"
