	},
	"sources": [
		"RP2350 datasheet (build 01/10/2026): §1.2.1.1 QFN-60 pinout, Tables 1674–1679 pin numbers (Table 1679 lists IOVDD on 54, which Figure 2 and Table 1675's QSPI_IOVDD place on 54: IOVDD is 1, 11, 20, 30, 38, 45), §9.4 GPIO function table (F1 SPI, F2 UART, F3 I2C, F4 PWM, F11 UART TX/RX on the CTS/RTS pins; SPI RX/TX written MISO/MOSI as on the RP2040), GPIO26–29 ADC0–3, ground through the exposed pad",
		"Hardware design with RP2350 (build 20/08/2026): external QSPI flash (W25Q128JVS on the minimal board), 12 MHz crystal, the core regulator's inductor",
		"PlatformIO raspberrypi@1.20.0 (the RP2040's) has no RP2350 board; maxgerhardt/platform-raspberrypi (arduino-pico core) has rpipico2, which Bringup's hal.h does not support (it accepts the mbed core only): RP2350 firmware does not build yet"
	]
